  "translation": "Gomme Eliya a re go Eliša: Dula fano, ⟨go koplega⟩, ka gobane Yahwe o ntšhile go fihla Bethele. Gomme Eliša a re: Ka bophelo bja Yahwe le ka bophelo bja moya wa gago, nke ke ka go tlogela. Gomme ba theoga Bethele.",
